      "subject": "דבלים",
      "rationale": "figi-gelelen kuliw — Heburu daɲɛ ye fɛn min bɛ kulu ye, Bamanankan deɲe fila de wajibiya."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "donni",
      "rationale": "שמחה ye diinɛ-donni laadalata ye Bamanankan na, wa jimɛtigi bɛ a ye."
    },
    {
      "kind": "elision",
      "subject": "וגם",
      "rationale": "Daɲɛ in daɲɛgafe yɛrɛ tɛ Bamanankan kɔnɔ; a bɛ jira ni 'o fila' ye."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "O fila, mɔgɔw minnu tun sigi u la surun, fo Yisaskar (Yisakari) ani Zebulun (Zebuluni) ani Naftali (Naftalidi) kama, u tun bɛ buru na — bɛ misikɔnɔminɛnw la, kamɛliw la, morow la ani misiw la — dunulanw: konofindi, jiriden-gelelenw (figi kuliw), diwɛn-furanw, diwɛn, tulu, misi ani saga caman na; sabu donni tun bɛ Israyɛl (Izraili) kɔnɔ.",
